                                "sense_id": "0d52bb57-13a9-36e4-998f-f769df808d76",
                                "text": "The adaptive filter tunes its gain automatically based on the system dynamitic sensed by the movement state to yield optimal performance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4abca81-7520-43f5-b2e3-faaf083590a9",
                                "sense_id": "0d52bb57-13a9-36e4-998f-f769df808d76",
                                "text": "As labor force participation rates change, they affect unemployment rates and other variables within the model, and once again the model's dynamitics come into play."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "79b539a8-9d2d-453b-ae95-c2062ff0a638",
                                "sense_id": "0d52bb57-13a9-36e4-998f-f769df808d76",
                                "text": "“I’m super stoked for this year,” Steketee said this week. “We have amazing girls that are returning and our team dynamitic is extremely powerful. They get along well and really want to work hard for each other.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
